{"firma": "8e631a12ecc7cf0e1f81f9564c543fb6375330bd", "file": "db_creature.hsp", "riga": 51263, "occorrenza": 0, "jp": "「漂う光の粒は私の心の影を和らげる」", "jp_grezzo": "\"「漂う光の粒は私の心の影を和らげる」\"", "en": "The particles of light soften the shadows in my heart.", "en_grezzo": "cnvtalk(\"The particles of light soften the shadows in my heart.\")", "tipo": "statica", "contesto": "", "it": "I granelli di luce che fluttuano addolciscono le ombre del mio cuore."}
