{"firma": "ffbfaf9bbcee4ae136bc8287a787704eaed7532b", "file": "db_creature.hsp", "riga": 85998, "occorrenza": 0, "jp": "「このケダモノどもの影におびえて暮らすのは、もうまっぴら御免よ」", "jp_grezzo": "\"「このケダモノどもの影におびえて暮らすのは、もうまっぴら御免よ」\"", "en": "I simply cannot accept a life of being constantly afraid of the shadows of monsters.", "en_grezzo": "cnvtalk(\"I simply cannot accept a life of being constantly afraid of the shadows of monsters.\")", "tipo": "statica", "contesto": "", "it": "Vivere nel terrore dell'ombra di queste bestie? Non ci sto più."}
{"firma": "239f3a7253942a453f0a33be931172d9e478d8ba", "file": "db_creature.hsp", "riga": 85998, "occorrenza": 0, "jp": "「絶望？それなら私が教えてあげるわ」", "jp_grezzo": "\"「絶望？それなら私が教えてあげるわ」\"", "en": "Despair? Let ME tell you about despair.", "en_grezzo": "cnvtalk(\"Despair? Let ME tell you about despair.\")", "tipo": "statica", "contesto": "", "it": "Disperazione? Te la insegno io, allora."}
{"firma": "7c197f2481ef013604179912575fc364dee7b2f8", "file": "db_creature.hsp", "riga": 85998, "occorrenza": 0, "jp": "「恐れを心に刻むといいわ！」", "jp_grezzo": "\"「恐れを心に刻むといいわ！」\"", "en": "It's good to carve the taste of fear into your heart!", "en_grezzo": "cnvtalk(\"It's good to carve the taste of fear into your heart!\")", "tipo": "statica", "contesto": "", "it": "Incidila nel cuore, la paura!"}
{"firma": "3c076fac6cc4986d7ec79d01c5b9b9fe68835a18", "file": "db_creature.hsp", "riga": 85998, "occorrenza": 0, "jp": "「私は今、ここにいる。そして、生きるために戦いつづけるの」", "jp_grezzo": "\"「私は今、ここにいる。そして、生きるために戦いつづけるの」\"", "en": "I may have changed, but I'm still alive. And I'll keep fighting to keep it that way.", "en_grezzo": "cnvtalk(\"I may have changed, but I'm still alive. And I'll keep fighting to keep it that way.\")", "tipo": "statica", "contesto": "", "it": "Io sono qui, adesso. E continuo a combattere per restare viva."}
{"firma": "b1f4dc1e1a9c4f3369b33564473daf12a8b10eca", "file": "db_creature.hsp", "riga": 86004, "occorrenza": 0, "jp": "「花は枯れても、また花を咲かせる・・・私たちも同じよ」", "jp_grezzo": "\"「花は枯れても、また花を咲かせる・・・私たちも同じよ」\"", "en": "Flowers blossom and wither... We are no different.", "en_grezzo": "cnvtalk(\"Flowers blossom and wither... We are no different.\")", "tipo": "statica", "contesto": "", "it": "I fiori appassiscono, e poi tornano a fiorire... per noi non è diverso."}
{"firma": "bef1f2069042d08333a8a1952c52ffa240c3f36f", "file": "db_creature.hsp", "riga": 86004, "occorrenza": 0, "jp": "「死んだらみんな再会するって母さんは言ってた・・・母さんに会えるかしら」", "jp_grezzo": "\"「死んだらみんな再会するって母さんは言ってた・・・母さんに会えるかしら」\"", "en": "Mom always told me that you're reunited with everyone once you die... I wonder if I'll get to see mom again.", "en_grezzo": "cnvtalk(\"Mom always told me that you're reunited with everyone once you die... I wonder if I'll get to see mom again.\")", "tipo": "statica", "contesto": "", "it": "La mamma diceva che dopo la morte ci si ritrova tutti... chissà se la rivedrò."}
{"firma": "0c3e803374116996f5cb8a076712148099773051", "file": "db_creature.hsp", "riga": 86010, "occorrenza": 0, "jp": "「あなたに神の祝福を受ける資格なんてないわ」", "jp_grezzo": "\"「あなたに神の祝福を受ける資格なんてないわ」\"", "en": "Someone like you isn't worthy to receive the blessings of the gods.", "en_grezzo": "cnvtalk(\"Someone like you isn't worthy to receive the blessings of the gods.\")", "tipo": "statica", "contesto": "", "it": "Tu non hai alcun diritto alla benedizione divina."}
{"firma": "73919f76862fe1c10181782ad218aedafc550629", "file": "db_creature.hsp", "riga": 86010, "occorrenza": 0, "jp": "「これ以上、だれも悲しませたくないから」", "jp_grezzo": "\"「これ以上、だれも悲しませたくないから」\"", "en": "No more. I won't allow you to make anyone sad any longer.", "en_grezzo": "cnvtalk(\"No more. I won't allow you to make anyone sad any longer.\")", "tipo": "statica", "contesto": "", "it": "Perché non voglio più veder soffrire nessuno."}
{"firma": "78201f0170a4bcf32c0cad1cc4b9ac0949e9f1fb", "file": "db_creature.hsp", "riga": 86739, "occorrenza": 0, "jp": "「締めあげちゃるぞ」", "jp_grezzo": "\"「締めあげちゃるぞ」\"", "en": "That's the last mistake you'll make.", "en_grezzo": "cnvtalk(\"That's the last mistake you'll make.\")", "tipo": "statica", "contesto": "", "it": "Adesso ti stringo per bene."}
{"firma": "54d1645ecc319469901238d46ed1ff8af36ba1cd", "file": "db_creature.hsp", "riga": 86739, "occorrenza": 0, "jp": "「活きがいいのぅ」", "jp_grezzo": "\"「活きがいいのぅ」\"", "en": "Being alive is a good thing.", "en_grezzo": "cnvtalk(\"Being alive is a good thing.\")", "tipo": "statica", "contesto": "", "it": "Che bel bocconcino vivace."}
{"firma": "93824376d2f0dc667550cb4bba6ea4aaf9a4deaa", "file": "db_creature.hsp", "riga": 86739, "occorrenza": 0, "jp": "「遊んでやるかの」", "jp_grezzo": "\"「遊んでやるかの」\"", "en": "Is this your idea of play?", "en_grezzo": "cnvtalk(\"Is this your idea of play?\")", "tipo": "statica", "contesto": "", "it": "Su, giochiamo un po'."}
